"u.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/biosav .html#c1>`__ on the centerline of a \\ "
"`current loop <http://hyperphysics.phy-astr.g "
"su.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/curlo o.html#c1>`__ involves integrating the "
"z-component."
msgstr ""
"在电流环轴线上应用 `比奥-萨伐尔定律 <http://hyperphysics.phy-astr.gs "
"u.edu/%E2%80%8Chbase/magnetic/biosav .html#c1>`__ 对 `电流环 "
